  "guid": "com.acidphantasm.letmeout",
  "name": "LET ME OUT",
  "slug": "let-me-out",
  "teaser": "Stops transit interaction from disabling all the other exfils. I want out, let me out!",
  "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/2944.png",
  "downloads": 7291,
  "favourites_count": 10,
  "description": "<p>All this does is allow you to exfil from other points on the map if you happen to accidentally interact with a transit.</p>\n<p>Transits still work with this mod. Probably. I tested one transit and it loaded.</p>\n<p>Whether or not this allows you to actually utilize the transit “send stuff to stash” if you choose not to transit - I have no idea. If your stuff goes poof that’s on you.</p>\n<p>Whether or not this works with Fika - I have no idea. If your raid blows up, or your Fika server crashes, or if Fika staff come to your house and beat you senseless, that’s on you. (If it works - great, let me know in the comments… if it doesn’t work - I’ll fix it eventually, maybe, or maybe not)</p>\n<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">INSTALLATION</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Installation</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Download LET ME OUT</li>\n<li>Open the downloaded zip file in 7-zip</li>\n<li>Select the BepInEx folder in the zip file in 7-zip</li>\n<li>Drag the BepInEx folder from 7-zip into your SPT folder</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Demonstration Video (yoink):</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mZ1aLrW.gif\" alt=\"mZ1aLrW.gif\" /></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">UNINSTALLATION</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ol>\n<li>Delete <code>/ROOTSPT/Bepinex/plugins/acidphantasm-letmeout</code></li>\n<li>Done</li>\n</ol></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">SUPPORT</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Please comment on the hub page, or preferably create an issue on the GitHub, or <em>more</em> preferably visit #acidphantasm-mods in the SPT Discord!</p></div></div></div>\n<p>If you enjoy my work - you can <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/acidphantasm\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">buy me a coffee</a>~</p>\n",
